{
  "description": "UniBridge corpus - REAL public documents for international students in Italy: the University of Camerino (UNICAM) and ERDIS Marche in depth, plus national rules valid everywhere (entry visa, residence permit, tax code, national health service, recognition of foreign qualifications, ISEE, national scholarship thresholds) and the right-to-study calls of other regions (Lazio, Toscana, Piemonte, Emilia-Romagna, Lombardia, Veneto, Sicilia, Puglia) with university guides from across Italy. Field `region` = region the document applies to (\"national\" = whole country). Downloaded by scripts/fetch_corpus_unibridge.py into data/raw/unibridge/ (not committed). For html items the script keeps only the page content region (selector) and turns FAQ question lines into <h3> headings, so that each FAQ answer becomes its own section; the original response hash is recorded too. Licence notes: docs/DATA_UNIBRIDGE.md.",
